{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 38, :comments ["<b>Before the eyes of all the house of Israel throughout all their journeys.</b> What Rashi explained — 'in every journey they traveled,' etc. — that means at every station where they encamped, as he himself explained shortly before; only he interpreted for you the language of the verse. <b>End of parashat Pekudei.</b> <b>The book of Exodus is concluded, with the help of HaShem.</b>"], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:16.587698563Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}